OL,3,AGovernment expands police support to
OL,4,Apolitical figures who are not MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical figures who are not currently
OL,7,FMPs will be given police support, the
OL,8,Fhome secretary has announced.
OL,10,FShabana Mahmood told MPs there was
OL,11,F"insufficient protection" for those
OL,12,Fserving in public life and that the new
OL,13,Fannouncement will cover peers, former
OL,14,FMPs and party spokespeople.
OL,16,FShe also announced an urgent,
OL,17,Findependent review of security
OL,18,Farrangements for high-profile figures
OL,19,Fincluding politicians and royals.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
